00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.030
The worst thing that you
can do is turn to the side

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.300
and sneeze, 'cause then
all the sneeze stuff,

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.133
all the sneeze stuff,

00:09:13.133 --> 00:09:15.287
all the sneeze particles
comes out onto the patient.

